        "* (This WF best for RDNA2 and below, I suggest using ck-attention for newer amd gpu's BEFORE SLA node.)\n\n- set the models,clip,vaes in easy loader.\n- enable-disable input images-audio-video according to your needs.\n- change the \"Mode\" in \"MinimMax H3 Easy\" node to your desired gen type.\n- Add your lightx or other loras after that and \n- MAKE SURE \"H3 SLA Attenion - ROCM\" is the last node after any loras."
